# Conformance probe pack used as an inner pack: a common `when … as` (spec
# 0.34 ruling 9, with 0.30), most significant bit first. Public. One kind (ruling 8 of 0.5), served by the common `when`.
#
#   byte 0      a common when, 1 or 2, bound to n
#   byte 1      y
format     conformance-inner-aswhen
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
when    8  1,2  as probe.n
kind    only
field   probe.y  8  uint
